Z||000000||88GTURBO||11-13-2001||05:54 PM||||Hello fellow Fiero owners. I suppose I'll start off with my car. 88 GT Burgundy with tan interior (beechwood). I've had it for a little over a year. But have been a fan since 84. I used to live in Pontiac and had family that worked at the Fiero plant. At any rate just hoping to talk to other enthusiasts. In the vast sea of riceburners its hard to find anybody that knows anything about a Fiero. So Greetings All<BR>Justis||||reg||1
